<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 30/MAY 2.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 30/MAY 2.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Monday, May 2 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   02.05.97	  30.04.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5220	    6.5036</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3160	    2.3095</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5210	   4.5072</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.1536	    3.1546</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5115	    0.5095</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7678	    0.7678</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2895	    0.2888</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8729	    6.8522</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6947	    0.6965</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2661	    1.2646</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
